WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:35.120
First up, the new sports. Every Olympics,

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.719
new ones can get added.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:39.040
But when was the last time they were

00:00:36.719 --> 00:00:42.320
this cool? Skateboarding,

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:44.800
surfing, sport climbing, karate, baseball

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:46.399
and softball. It's part of a plan by the

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:48.320
International Olympic Committee

00:00:46.399 --> 00:00:49.440
to make the games more appealing to

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:51.680
younger people.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:53.920
And Sky Brown can probably help with

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:53.920
that.

00:01:03.359 --> 00:01:08.960
At just 13 years old,

00:01:06.479 --> 00:01:11.119
Sky is a skateboarding prodigy and a

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:12.880
medal contender for Great Britain.

00:01:11.119 --> 00:01:14.479
And there are no age restrictions in

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:16.720
skateboarding so you've also

00:01:14.479 --> 00:01:19.600
got South Africa's Dallas Oberholzer,

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:21.360
who's 46.

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:50.720
So it's a pretty big deal

00:01:49.119 --> 00:01:51.520
when new sports are included in the

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:54.960
Olympics.

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:54.960
It's almost like a seal of approval. 

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:09.599
It's the same for karate. And the fact

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:12.640
that it's debuting in Japan

00:02:09.599 --> 00:02:13.280
is extra special. 

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:37.360
But of course there's still a pandemic

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:38.480
going on, which brings us to our second

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:41.760
thing you need to know —

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:43.920
there are lots of COVID-19 restrictions.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:45.920
It means the games are going to look and

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:47.760
feel really different.

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:49.280
There's a whole playbook of dos and

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:52.000
don'ts for athletes —

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:53.680
70 pages of rules about testing, mask

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:56.239
wearing and travel logistics.

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:59.519
No hugging or handshakes. And no hanging

00:02:56.239 --> 00:03:06.560
around in Japan once your event is done.

00:02:59.519 --> 00:03:06.560
But the biggest change – none of this.

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:10.480
And more of this.

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:16.800
The Japanese government recently

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:19.440
declared a state of emergency in Tokyo

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:20.400
after COVID-19 cases started climbing

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:22.560
again.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:23.760
Spectators are banned from the venues in

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:25.360
and around the capital

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:27.120
although in other parts of the country

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:29.760
venues can be filled to 50%

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:33.840
capacity with a cap of 10,000 people in

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:33.840
the stands.

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:50.319
To call it disappointing is probably the

00:03:48.239 --> 00:03:50.959
gold medal of understatements for sports

00:03:50.319 --> 00:03:52.879
fans

00:03:50.959 --> 00:03:54.480
and for some athletes who won't be able

00:03:52.879 --> 00:03:57.360
to feed off the crowd.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:33.199
And there's something else to factor in

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:34.240
this year, and this is the third thing

00:04:33.199 --> 00:04:36.160
you need to know.

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:37.680
There's been a lot of opposition from

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:39.600
the Japanese public.

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:41.120
Back in May, a poll showed that 83%

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:41.759
of people wanted the games

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:44.240
cancelled

00:04:41.759 --> 00:04:46.240
or postponed, although more recent polls

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:47.199
show that number is down to around 30%.

00:04:47.199 --> 00:04:50.320
People are worried about what the

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:51.360
Olympics mean for the spread of COVID-19.

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:54.479
Even without spectators you're still

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:56.960
talking something like

00:04:54.479 --> 00:04:58.800
90,000 people travelling to Japan from

00:04:56.960 --> 00:05:00.960
more than 200 countries.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:02.960
And at the beginning of July less than

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:11.840
10% of Japan's population was

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:11.840
fully vaccinated.

00:05:16.479 --> 00:05:20.080
But in the end Japan had a really tough

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:22.720
decision to make.

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:24.560
There are billions of dollars at stake.

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:25.199
If you count up all the money spent on

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:27.520
venues,

00:05:25.199 --> 00:05:28.479
sponsorship and partnership deals, media

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:30.560
advertising

00:05:28.479 --> 00:05:32.880
and add the extra cost of postponing the

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:35.280
games, these are looking like the most

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:36.160
expensive Olympics in history. 

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:53.360
So basically hardly

00:05:51.039 --> 00:05:54.560
any fans, lots of Japanese people annoyed

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:57.120
that it's happening at all

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:57.680
and there are major concerns about COVID.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.680
But

00:05:57.680 --> 00:06:01.280
it's the Olympics. Let's not

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:02.639
underestimate the power of these

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:05.360
athletes to inspire us

00:06:02.639 --> 00:06:07.919
and take us on a wild ride. Here are some

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:10.639
to watch out for:

00:06:07.919 --> 00:06:11.759
Top of the list, American gymnast Simone

00:06:10.639 --> 00:06:13.919
Biles.

00:06:11.759 --> 00:06:16.319
And the big question — will she attempt

00:06:13.919 --> 00:06:18.720
the Yurchenko double pike vault?

00:06:16.319 --> 00:06:19.440
The what? 

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:31.440
In other words it's a

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:33.759
supremely difficult move

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:35.280
and Biles is the only female gymnast to

00:06:33.759 --> 00:06:36.319
ever land one successfully in a

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:38.479
competition.

00:06:36.319 --> 00:06:40.240
She did that in May. 

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:46.560
Others on the watch list

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:48.319
include Japan's Naomi Osaka — she's

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:50.319
returning to tennis after she took a

00:06:48.319 --> 00:06:53.039
break to look after her mental health.

00:06:50.319 --> 00:06:53.840
There's Kenya's Eliud Kipchoge, described

00:06:53.039 --> 00:06:56.319
as the best

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:58.560
marathoner ever. Laurel Hubbard, from New

00:06:56.319 --> 00:07:00.000
Zealand, who can lift more than 150

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:02.319
kilogrammes over her head

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.440
and is the first openly transgender

00:07:02.319 --> 00:07:05.039
Olympian.

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:07.360
And while we're talking inspiring

00:07:05.039 --> 00:07:07.759
athletes, the refugee team is back this

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:10.880
year

00:07:07.759 --> 00:07:13.120
after making their debut at Rio 2016.

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:14.880
They're a team of 29 men and women

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:16.000
who've all had to leave their homes

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:18.560
under duress to find

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:20.560
a new place to live and train. There's

00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:22.080
the sport shooter Luna Solomon, who

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:25.039
escaped from Eritrea.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:26.240
Syrian boxer Wessam Salamana and Iranian

00:07:25.039 --> 00:07:29.919
taekwondo athlete

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:30.880
Dina Pouryounes. 

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:45.919
The thing about

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:47.840
these games is whatever the issues

00:07:45.919 --> 00:07:50.479
around them, whether that's politics,

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:53.039
money or even a pandemic, it's about the

00:07:50.479 --> 00:07:55.520
hopes and dreams of so many people.

00:07:53.039 --> 00:07:56.240
The mood in Tokyo now seems to be, let's

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:58.479
be safe

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:59.599
and do our best. And maybe that's what

00:07:58.479 --> 00:08:01.360
the Olympic spirit

00:07:59.599 --> 00:08:04.319
is all about. 

