You can catch our coverage of the

00:08:23.039 --> 00:08:27.039
Olympics over on aljazeera.com and you

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:28.879
can find more Start Here episodes on

00:08:27.039 --> 00:08:30.479
Instagram, Twitter or Facebook.

00:08:28.879 --> 00:08:32.399
Also make sure to subscribe to our

00:08:30.479 --> 00:08:34.640
YouTube channel so you won't miss our

